warning[slice-copy]: slice copies elements that method only reads
 --> src/SliceCopyPositive.jl:5:48
  |
5 | column_total(A::Matrix{Float64}, j::Int) = sum(A[:, j])
  |                                            ------------ only reads copy
  |                                                ^^^^^^^ copies elements here
  |
  = why: copy allocates new array; view reads same elements in place
  = fix: wrap slice in `@view(…)`: view reads same elements without copy   [likely]
